    "name": "BlastLast",
    "steam_appid": 3045240,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/d1d4e442d880ce81e999cd284b874ef6.poster.avif?t=1732903687\" width=600 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/d1d4e442d880ce81e999cd284b874ef6.webm?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/d1d4e442d880ce81e999cd284b874ef6.mp4?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/6199a81e3dc29bafeb2e1e127402f441.avif?t=1732903687\" width=640 height=85 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE BOMBERMAN GREAT AGAIN</h2><br>Re-creation of the Classic! In the reborn of BomberMan, you can now choose one of 4 characters to <strong>BLAST</strong> the <strong>LAST</strong> enemy and survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MECHANICS</h2><br>As in classic Bomberman, gameplay involves strategically placing down bombs, which explode in multiple directions after a certain amount of time, in order to destroy obstacles and other players. The player can pick up various power-ups, giving them benefits such as larger explosions, movement speed up or the ability to place more bombs down at a time. The player is killed if get caught up in a bomb's explosion, including their own, requiring players to be cautious of their own bomb placement.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/1fe260892cdfc28ee11a86205fda6ff4.poster.avif?t=1732903687\" width=650 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/1fe260892cdfc28ee11a86205fda6ff4.webm?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/1fe260892cdfc28ee11a86205fda6ff4.mp4?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFERENCES FROM THE CLASSIC BOMBERMAN</h2><br>You can choose one of 4 characters - Ninja, Mutant, Quinx and Zlorp.<br>Each of characters have specific ultimate magic - it's &quot;Superspeed&quot;, &quot;Shield of Immortality&quot;, &quot;Time-slow&quot; and &quot;Invisibility&quot;.<br>One exception - Mutant also have a <strong>DASH</strong> which pushes him forward and has a 3 second cooldown. Also, the mutant is not affected by speed power-ups and always moves very slowly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/a54fe094b23606d59af552d5c7ae0b08.poster.avif?t=1732903687\" width=650 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/a54fe094b23606d59af552d5c7ae0b08.webm?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/a54fe094b23606d59af552d5c7ae0b08.mp4?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br>- 2-8 player online PvP<br>- 3 types of camera: Classic Bomberman, First Person and Third Person cameras<br>- 4 characters to choose<br>- 4 ultimates that can change the winner<br>- Create the party with invited friends<br>- Join to the random party with strangers<br>- Some stuff on the map can be destroyed<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIMITATIONS OF DEMO VERSION</h2>- Only Classic Bomberman camera (no First and Thirs person)<br>- Only one character (Ninja) to play<br>- Only one map to play<br>- No leaderboard",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/d1d4e442d880ce81e999cd284b874ef6.poster.avif?t=1732903687\" width=600 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/d1d4e442d880ce81e999cd284b874ef6.webm?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/d1d4e442d880ce81e999cd284b874ef6.mp4?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/6199a81e3dc29bafeb2e1e127402f441.avif?t=1732903687\" width=640 height=85 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE BOMBERMAN GREAT AGAIN</h2><br>Re-creation of the Classic! In the reborn of BomberMan, you can now choose one of 4 characters to <strong>BLAST</strong> the <strong>LAST</strong> enemy and survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MECHANICS</h2><br>As in classic Bomberman, gameplay involves strategically placing down bombs, which explode in multiple directions after a certain amount of time, in order to destroy obstacles and other players. The player can pick up various power-ups, giving them benefits such as larger explosions, movement speed up or the ability to place more bombs down at a time. The player is killed if get caught up in a bomb's explosion, including their own, requiring players to be cautious of their own bomb placement.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/1fe260892cdfc28ee11a86205fda6ff4.poster.avif?t=1732903687\" width=650 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/1fe260892cdfc28ee11a86205fda6ff4.webm?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/1fe260892cdfc28ee11a86205fda6ff4.mp4?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFERENCES FROM THE CLASSIC BOMBERMAN</h2><br>You can choose one of 4 characters - Ninja, Mutant, Quinx and Zlorp.<br>Each of characters have specific ultimate magic - it's &quot;Superspeed&quot;, &quot;Shield of Immortality&quot;, &quot;Time-slow&quot; and &quot;Invisibility&quot;.<br>One exception - Mutant also have a <strong>DASH</strong> which pushes him forward and has a 3 second cooldown. Also, the mutant is not affected by speed power-ups and always moves very slowly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/a54fe094b23606d59af552d5c7ae0b08.poster.avif?t=1732903687\" width=650 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/a54fe094b23606d59af552d5c7ae0b08.webm?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045240/extras/a54fe094b23606d59af552d5c7ae0b08.mp4?t=1732903687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br>- 2-8 player online PvP<br>- 3 types of camera: Classic Bomberman, First Person and Third Person cameras<br>- 4 characters to choose<br>- 4 ultimates that can change the winner<br>- Create the party with invited friends<br>- Join to the random party with strangers<br>- Some stuff on the map can be destroyed<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIMITATIONS OF DEMO VERSION</h2>- Only Classic Bomberman camera (no First and Thirs person)<br>- Only one character (Ninja) to play<br>- Only one map to play<br>- No leaderboard",
    "short_description": "Old classic Bomber Man in new point of view! Your goal is simple: Blast all enemies by the bombs. Go alone with up to 8 players or assemble the party in online PvP. Choose one of 4 characters, use your specific ultimate, be smart and create strategies to win.",
